  `choupo-curate revert`) on 2026-11-10 into
  data/standards/components/dimethylSulfoxide.dat as reviewStatus
  autoPromoted, humanReviewed false, because: verdict validated (the
  record's Tb is inside the measured span or not declared; the fit's own
  normal boiling point is 465.48 K). THEN C283, every usable study fitted
  and none held out, accepted only at max relative error <= 5 % and Tnb
  within 1 K (superseded by the graded acceptance of C285): WHAT THE RUN
  FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued). Objective twoStage.
  Antoine log10(Psat/bar) = 4.693650 - 1946.0170/(T + -48.5201),
  in-sample R2 0.999995 over 49 kept points, 293.15-463.45 K
  (10.1016/j.fluid.2011.02.002 21/21 kept; 10.1021/je400531a 19/19 kept;
