  mean 21.3045 %, max 35.9060 %. Outliers discarded: none. Its own normal
  boiling point (101.325 kPa): 463.63 K. PROMOTED on 2026-11-10 into
  data/standards/components/dimethylSulfoxide.dat as reviewStatus
  autoPromoted, humanReviewed false, because: under the DEFAULT
  acceptance of DEV.md 4c C283 (no system/curationDict), 3 studies, 49
  points kept, 0 discarded as outliers; max relative error 0.7943 % (mean
  0.5975 %) against 5 %; Tb inside the kept points' range, normal boiling
  point 463.63 K, +1.48 K from the record's Tb 462.15 K (reported, not a
  condition); AmbroseWalton on the same points mean 21.3 % / max 35.91 %
  @@EARLIER-END@@

  NO MEASURED POINT IS IN THIS TREE: constant/archiveDatasets declares every
  series by DOI, NIST URL and sha256; `bin/choupo-curate fetch` regenerates
  them into constant/archiveExtracts/ (gitignored).

  RESULT
  @@RESULT-BEGIN@@
  WHAT THE RUN FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued).
